#@ readme_auth
An API key sent in a request header (`x-api-key` in `credentials.py`; change it to the header the
service documents). Put it in the credential store with `catalog-sync login {{name}} --paste-curl -`
(a cURL command that carries the header) or write the file yourself: a line `API_KEY=<the key>` in
`<workspace>/credentials/{{name}}.cred`, readable by you only (`chmod 600`). A key has no expiry the
tool can read, so `auth status` reports `unknown`; rotate it on the schedule the service sets.
